# schema inspection — Phase 2.4 occupancy surface, read from the running local database
# captured 2026-10-27, after the idempotent re-apply recorded in migration-reapply-occupancy-phase2.4.out
# command: docker exec -i supabase_db_spotlight psql -U postgres -d postgres -f - < docs/qa/estate-uat-443/live-2026-10-27/05-schema-occupancy.sql

Border style is 2.
